---
title: How to watermark a PDF
description: Add text or image watermarks to every page — free, private, in your browser.
relatedTool: watermark-pdf
---

Stamp drafts, confidential labels, or logos across your PDF pages.

## Steps

1. Open **Watermark PDF**.
2. Upload the document.
3. Choose text or image watermark and adjust opacity, position, and rotation.
4. Apply to all pages (or a range) and download.

## Tips

> **Tip:** Use a semi-transparent diagonal text watermark for drafts so content stays readable.

